   * ROADMAP_hvm).
   *
   * Premium geometry: 2 banks at cluster level
   * (u_ae350_hvm_ram_subsystem), bank = byte-address bit
   * _NDS_HVM_ADDR_BANK_BIT (bank0 = low half, bank1 = high half), rows of
   * VlWide<16> (512 data bits), no ECC/parity -- unlike ILM/DLM there is no
   * code generation and no enable bit. Zero-fills past data.size() like
   * set_ilm/set_dlm.
   *
   * @param data Bytes to load (little-endian), size <= SIZE bytes
